      "Eligibility verification is the first step in the revenue cycle and one of the most consequential. If coverage details are wrong at the start, everything downstream suffers: claims deny, patients receive unexpected bills, and staff spend hours on rework. A thorough eligibility check takes a few minutes and prevents most of those problems.",
      "## Active coverage is just the beginning",
      "Many teams stop once they confirm a policy is active on the date of service. That is necessary but not sufficient. A complete check also confirms that the plan covers the specific service, at the specific location, from the specific provider, and tells you what the patient will owe.",
