      "As Medicare Advantage enrollment has grown, so has the share of providers' time spent on MA denials. MA plans use prior authorization, medical necessity review, and payment policies that traditional Medicare does not, and they apply them at scale. Understanding how MA denials work, and the specific rights that come with the MA program, helps you push back effectively.",
      "## Common causes of MA denials",
      "- Missing or mismatched prior authorization for services the plan requires.",
      "- Medical necessity determinations, especially for post-acute care, inpatient admissions, and advanced imaging.",
